Row 1 (left to right):
1. One heavy arrow buried in the center of a round target of thick concentric rings, seen at a slight tilt.
2. Three heavy arrows flying side by side on a diagonal, thick speed streaks behind them.
3. Five heavy arrows fanning out from one point toward the upper right.

Row 2 (left to right):
4. One heavy arrow on a bold curving flight path, its head striking a thick cracked plate.
5. One heavy arrow flying straight through three thick upright plates in a row.
6. One big arrowhead pointing down and to the right, three fat drops falling from its tip.

Row 3 (left to right):
7. One heavy arrow with a jagged ice-crystal head flying on a diagonal, one chunky snowflake beside it.
8. A hooded figure ducking low to the side as a heavy arrow flies just past above it, a clean gap between them.
9. A hand snatching a heavy arrow mid-air on a diagonal, thick speed streaks behind the hand.
